    "corrections": [
      "0351: silver letters remain on stone table; increased tabletop contrast and outline; lamps have supporting tables; three young birds on a branch attached to a visible tree; stone window stays closed until page15.",
      "0352: table woodgrain directions and turntable alignment match train mechanics; train partly off table before full boarding; white-haired passenger stays in square-window wagon; drawing and writing hands meet pencils.",
      "0353: three colored keys and twelve coins; transparent preview furniture and model distinguish unreal view; flipped model crank meets operator hand; rings lowered below faces and stools support two visitors.",
      "0354: three telescope legs and two copper ears; old comet only on paper; daytime window starless; naked-eye moon broad patches precede crater drawing; profile eye aligned to eyepiece; both charts appear in envelope scene.",
      "0355: four house feet stay down until emptied; lost glove/scope removed after collection, deer removed only after reunion; lidless candy box open rim; cleaning hands/cloth align with window and deer; mother present after cabinet move; reunion antler touches palm; reduced railway and cracked roof persist."
    ],
    "limitations": "Simplified original geometric storybook scenes. Contact-sheet inspection and selected fullsize inspection are recorded separately; this is not human full audio listening or deployment."
